  "tests": "Toyota adaptation store: 96 write cuts, 768 bit faults, reset and rollover passed.\nToyota adaptation recovery: 96 write cuts, 768 bit faults in either slot, and rollover passed.\nToyota S01 adaptation baseline: empty, valid, and unreadable startup passed.\nToyota GP runtime: typed shared state, FAST and MAIN handoff, and rollback passed.\nToyota MAIN engine inputs: qualified source, ECT/RPM publication, and fallback passed.\nToyota 05518C: SECONDARY load qualifiers, hysteresis, clamp, fallback and MAIN handoff passed.\nToyota S01 range: P/N to warm low-load D, standstill fill, S1/S2 and first upshift passed.\nToyota scheduler: event release, FAST phase latch, busy drop and rollover passed.\nVerified 292 GP transfer fields and five donor hydraulic snapshots.\nController tests passed: six ADC ranges, relays, Auto, Tiptronic, OD, S1/S2, ST and SLT.",
